    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>PCl</mi><mrow><mn>5</mn><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced></mrow></msub><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mtext>&#160;order&#160;</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>300</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow></mfrac><msub><mi>PCl</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>Cl</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced></mrow></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>[</mo><msub><mi>PCl</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo>]</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>120</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>[</mo><msub><mi>PCl</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo>]</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>120</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>min</mi><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mfrac><mi>log</mi><mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></msub></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn></mrow><mn>120</mn></mfrac><mi>log</mi><mfrac><mn>50</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><mat